msgstr "Ineenstorting Verslag"

#: zenmapGUI/CrashReport.py:166
#, python-format
msgid ""
"An unexpected error has crashed %(app_name)s. Please copy the stack trace "
"below and send it to the <a href=\"mailto:dev@nmap.org\">dev@nmap.org</a> "
"mailing list. (<a href=\"http://seclists.org/nmap-dev/\">More about the "
"list.</a>) The developers will see your report and try to fix the problem."
msgstr ""
"'N Onverwagte fout het %(app_name)s omgeval. Kopieer asseblief die "
"stapelspoor hieronder en stuur dit na die <a "
"href=\"mailto:dev@nmap.org\">dev@nmap.org</a>-poslys. (<a "
"href=\"http://seclists.org/nmap-dev/\">Meer oor die lys.</a>) Die "
"ontwikkelaars sal jou verslag sien en probeer om die probleem op te los."

#: zenmapGUI/CrashReport.py:174
msgid ""
